# Prompt Vault — MVP Blueprint

TARGET USERS
Video editors and motion designers

PROBLEM TO SOLVE
Creative professionals need a quick way to save, find and reuse their image and video prompts.

VERSION 1 FEATURES
1. Save prompts by category
2. Search prompts instantly
3. Copy prompts with one click
4. Edit and delete saved prompts

STORAGE
Browser local storage. No login or cloud sync. Data loss and device limitations must be explained.

OUT OF SCOPE
- AI prompt rewriting
- Cloud collaboration
- Automatic video generation

ACCEPTANCE CRITERIA
- Every selected feature performs its real intended action.
- Saved data survives browser refresh in the intended storage environment.
- Empty states and invalid input are handled.
- Users receive accurate feedback for successes and failures.
- Interface works on mobile and desktop.
- Keyboard navigation and accessible labels are tested.
- No fake buttons, hardcoded success responses or unrelated features.
- Users are informed that clearing browser data can remove saved records.

PROCESS
Plan first. Implement one feature at a time. Review diffs and tests. Do not deploy without approval.
